  introLines:
  - "Lale Apart! Altta konsept bir market a\xE7\u0131yoruz, \xFCst\xFCnde alt\u0131
    daire. Hepsi \xF6n sat\u0131\u015Fta gitti {hitap}!"
  questions:
  - question: "Zemin kat tavan\u0131 ka\xE7 metre?"
    answer: "Tam d\xF6rt metre {hitap}! Projede ne yaz\u0131yorsa o, bir santim \u015Fa\u015Fmad\u0131k."
  - question: "Zemin katta ta\u015F\u0131y\u0131c\u0131 duvar var m\u0131?"
    answer: "Yok, ba\u015Ftan sona cam vitrin. Konsept bu, a\xE7\u0131kl\u0131k laz\u0131m."
